            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me apaka Rwoth waco: I kabedo me ma wiluwo kwoŋe ni, “Othangere m'ongoye ji kodi ogwaŋe.” I tindin ma Yuda kodi i royin ma Yerusalem m'odoŋ nono, m'ongoye ji ma jobed'iye, ji kosa ogwaŋe, kendo bino winjere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
